  "releaseNotes": "- Added the authenticated UpdateUser MVC endpoint and its WCF contract integration.\n\t\t  - Improved company resolution and validation for user creation, update, preview, and loading operations.\n\t\t  - Restored the generic user update flow based on Mbs_User_SetRegistration_Update and preserved existing company assignment behavior.\n\t\t  - Removed DVOSchool-specific NFC credential changes from generic user contracts and added an explicit maintenance script for installations that applied the preliminary migration.\n\t\t  - Updated characterization tests and service communication documentation for the final user-management contracts.\n\t\t  - NuGet package update.",
